# ChartPilot — environment variables live per-package, not at the repo root.
#
# For local development, copy the backend template and fill in real values:
#
#     cp backend/.env.example backend/.env      # then edit backend/.env (gitignored)
#
# The offline gate (`make check`) needs NO key and NO network. You only need a
# GEMINI_API_KEY for the live path (`make live-test`) or a real deploy (infra/).
#
# See backend/.env.example for the full, documented list of variables.
